#: ../../../developer/services/admin-api.rst:723
#: 5c9c045decf44c81877c27863274bbc2
msgid ""
"``managed-by-<vm>`` — Can be used for the same purpose, but it is not "
"created automatically, nor is it forbidden to set or reset this tag."
