#: ../../../developer/services/admin-api.rst:807
#: 79a57bf3bcd74989be05b381358c20f4
msgid ""
"Both device and assignment serialization is ASCII-encoded and contains space-"
"separated key-value pairs. The format includes an ``=`` between the key and "
"value, and the value is always enclosed in single quotes (``'``). Values may "
"contain spaces or even single quotes, which are escaped with a backslash. If "
"a value is not set (``None``), it is represented as ``'unknown'``. For "
"boolean values, ``True`` is represented as ``'yes'``, and ``False`` as "
"``'no'``. The order of key-value pairs is irrelevant. Keys starting with "
"``_`` are considered extra properties and are saved in ``data`` or "
"``options`` for device or assignment respectively."
msgstr ""

